<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1FY25 (Quarter Ended 30 June 2024) Financial Data

## Data Availability Summary

Before presenting the findings, an important disclosure limitation must be flagged: the URL specified for this task (`adityabirlacapital.com/healthinsurance/about-us/financials`) and its associated public-disclosure PDF currently serve a **stale filing dated for the quarter ended 31 December 2016** — not Q1FY25. Despite extensive searching (IRDAI NL-1/NL-2 returns, balance sheet disclosures, and site-specific PDF searches), no Q1FY25-dated (quarter ended 30 June 2024) IRDAI statutory public-disclosure document could be located for Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd.

As a result, the only genuinely verifiable Q1FY25 figures come from **Aditya Birla Capital's press release on unaudited financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2024**, which discloses select headline metrics for the health insurance subsidiary.

## Q1FY25 Data Table

| company | period | line_item | basis | value | unit | source_name | source_url | filing_date |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY25 | Total GWP | IGAAP | **1041** | INR_crore | Aditya Birla Capital Press Release – Unaudited Financial Results for Quarter Ended June 30, 2024 | https://www.adityabirla.com/en/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-unaudited-financial-results-for-quarter-ended-june-2024/ | 2024-07-31 |
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY25 | Combined ratio | IGAAP | **112** | % | Aditya Birla Capital Press Release – Unaudited Financial Results for Quarter Ended June 30, 2024 | https://www.adityabirla.com/en/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-unaudited-financial-results-for-quarter-ended-june-2024/ | 2024-07-31 |
| Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd | Q1FY25 | Retail health market share | — | **12.5** | % | Aditya Birla Capital Press Release – Unaudited Financial Results for Quarter Ended June 30, 2024 | https://www.adityabirla.com/en/media/press-releases/aditya-birla-capital-unaudited-financial-results-for-quarter-ended-june-2024/ | 2024-07-31 |

**All other requested line items** — Retail health GWP, Net Written Premium (NWP), Net Earned Premium (NEP), PAT (IGAAP & IFRS), Claims ratio (IGAAP & IFRS), Expense ratio, Expense of Management (EoM) ratio, Commission ratio, Solvency ratio, Net worth, Assets Under Management (AUM), and Investment yield — **could not be verified** in any Q1FY25-dated source and are therefore omitted per the strict no-estimation rule.

## Key Caveats & Sourcing Notes

- **Total GWP (₹1,041 crore):** Disclosed verbatim as "Health insurance gross written premium: Rs.1,041 crore (↑35% y-o-y)." The source does **not** specify whether this is on a 1/n (statutory) or ex-1/n basis. Per task rules favoring the statutory 1/n basis, this figure should be **treated with caution** and cross-checked against the statutory NL-1 return once located.

- **Combined ratio (112%):** Explicitly stated as "improved to 112% from 118% in Q1 FY24." This is ABHI's standalone combined ratio, but note it is sourced from the parent (ABCL) press release rather than a dedicated ABHI investor deck or statutory filing — no standalone Q1FY25 ABHI investor presentation appears to exist publicly.

- **Retail health market share (12.5%):** The source describes this as ABHI's market share **among standalone health insurers (SAHI)**, which increased by 92 bps year-on-year to 12.5%. This has been mapped to the closest matching requested line item, though it technically reflects SAHI-segment share rather than a distinct "retail health" sub-segment metric.

### Why the Statutory IGAAP Line Items Are Blank

The task specification called for sourcing NWP, NEP, Expense of Management, Net worth, and Investments/AUM from the company's **IRDAI quarterly "NL" public-disclosure return set** (NL-1 Revenue Account, NL-2 expense schedule, Balance Sheet) for Q1FY25. However:

- The designated financials page's public-disclosure PDF is **stale**, dated for the quarter ended **31 December 2016** — not the requested period.
- No Q1FY25-dated (quarter ended 30 June 2024) NL return set was discoverable elsewhere on the company's website or via targeted web searches.
- Per the strict task rule against estimation, no figures were backed into or interpolated from the disclosed ratios (e.g., NWP/NEP were not derived from GWP and combined ratio).

## Recommended Next Steps

To complete this dataset with verified statutory IGAAP figures, consider:

1. **IRDAI portal (irdai.gov.in)** — check the insurer-wise public disclosures repository directly, as regulatory filings are sometimes archived there even when a company's own website link is broken or outdated.
2. **Direct outreach to ABHI/ABCL Investor Relations** — request the Q1FY25 NL-1/NL-2/Balance Sheet disclosure PDF directly, since the company's own designated URL is not currently serving the correct period.
3. **Alternative date range check** — verify whether the company has since updated its financials page; the stale 2016 PDF suggests a possible site migration or broken-link issue that may be resolved in future site refreshes.</ans>
